 <LayoutItem background="false" blendMode="0" excludeFromExports="0" frame="false" frameJoinStyle="miter" groupUuid="" halign="1" htmlState="0" id="" itemRotation="0" labelText="Each pair shows the shorter estimate (left) and longer estimate (right). Black fills clockwise through a fixed 15-hour period.&#xa;Lake pies: longest modeled crossing. Carry pies: double-carry travel + handling. Exact hours remain in the instructor register.&#xa;White = zero; full black = 15 hours. No pie = no estimate. This daylight-length unit is an assumption, not a seasonal forecast." marginX="0" marginY="0" opacity="1" outlineWidthM="0.3,mm" position="15,573,mm" positionLock="false" positionOnPage="15,573,mm" referencePoint="0" size="575,25,mm" templateUuid="{7d6fe07d-63cd-4937-bd44-d94b39169acf}" type="65641" uuid="{7d6fe07d-63cd-4937-bd44-d94b39169acf}" valign="32" visibility="1" zValue="8">
